        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD B4010-6, 6\" Single Acting Stainless Steel Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with a Pair (2) Single Action Spring Door Hinges, Tension Adjusting Tool, Locking Pins and 1\" wood  screws.  Non-template screw hole pattern.  For wood or metal doors 1-1/4\" - 1-3/4\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Tension Tool is use to adjust spring tension.  The Locking Pins hold the Spring in tension after it is set. These adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply  to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> for the DWD-B4010-6 6\" Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Corners</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .120</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Non-Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: Qty (10) 1\" Wood Screws</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Torque</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-B4010-6-specifications.pdf?v=1774586591\" target=\"new\"><b>DWD B4010-6 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><!-- START Bommer 4010 -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">DWD-B4010-6 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">DWD Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>4010-6</td>\r\n<td>125 lbs</td>\r\n<td>3'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>155 lbs</td>\r\n<td>4'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>1-3/4\"</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"6\"><span class=\"text\">Hinges constructed of 304 Stainless Steel</span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p><!-- END Bommer 4010 -->\r\n<p>\r\n<b>**Comparable to Discontinued</b> <a href=\"/products/6-inch-single-acting-spring-hinge-pair-bommer-4010-6\"><b>Bommer 4010-6  Spring Hinge.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>",
